• Expertise in using tools, systems, and processes for successful end-to-end project management. &nbsp; &nbsp;

• A proactive approach to project scoping, consistently anticipating next steps, likely questions, and potential roadblocks. &nbsp; &nbsp;

• Overseen end-to-end billing management, including PO creation, invoice receipts, and tracking actuals. &nbsp; &nbsp;

• Deep familiarity with trafficking workflows, campaign management processes, creative specifications, and operational documentation &nbsp; &nbsp;

